# English UI and comments

All player-facing text and all code comments are English. Do not add Russian (or any other language) to HUD, labels, prompts, prefab default strings, or comments.

```csharp
// BAD
return $"до платформы {minutes}:{remainder:00}";
// оставшееся время до посадки

// GOOD
return $"to platform {minutes}:{remainder:00}";
// remaining time until landing
```

Chat with the user may be in Russian. Game strings and comments stay English.
